        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">当一个构装体可见的生物在其10 尺距离内开始回合时，构装生物可以强迫其进行一次感知豁免对抗你的法术豁免DC，豁免失败则其直到其下个回合开始前不能使用反应，且速度减半。</span></p><p>When a creature the construct can see starts its turn within 10 feet of the construct, the construct can force it to make a Wisdom saving throw against your spell save DC. On a failed save, the target can't use reactions and its speed is halved until the start of its next turn.</p></div>",
